# src/

CLI application source code for the Udex universal lookup directory. Contains the command-line interface, argument parsing, gRPC client utilities, and configuration loading for the `udex` binary.

## Files

- `main.rs` -- CLI entry point, error handling, and gRPC-to-exit-code mapping
- `cli.rs` -- Clap command-line interface definition with subcommands and output formats
- `commands.rs` -- Command implementations (Config, Index, Entry, Token, Context, Serve)
- `client.rs` -- gRPC channel and TLS configuration, bearer token injection interceptor
- `config.rs` -- Udex configuration types for server, datastore, and secrets binding
